# Direct pip-overlay requirements for the speech intent.
# speechbrain has no conda distribution on any channel; it arrives through the
# controlled offline overlay lane. Capped below 1.1: speechbrain 1.1.0 requires
# soundfile>=0.12.1 (conda-forge pysoundfile tops out at 0.11, and shadowing a
# conda-provided distribution is refused), while speechbrain<=1.0.3 requires
# torchaudio<2.9 (it calls torchaudio.list_audio_backends, removed in 2.9) --
# hence this intent's own torchaudio<2.9 conda pin. Revisit both caps when
# conda-forge pysoundfile reaches 0.12.
speechbrain<1.1
